240
00:09:23,138 --> 00:09:25,426
Electric range also shifted.

241
00:09:25,606 --> 00:09:28,579
The March twenty twelve report says twenty-five

242
00:09:28,579 --> 00:09:29,274
kilometres.

243
00:09:29,454 --> 00:09:33,303
Porsche's twenty thirteen release says over thirty

244
00:09:33,303 --> 00:09:35,689
kilometres in ideal conditions.

245
00:09:35,869 --> 00:09:39,857
Wikipedia lists the EPA all-electric range as

246
00:09:39,857 --> 00:09:42,870
nineteen kilometres, twelve miles.

247
00:09:43,050 --> 00:09:44,260
By our arithmetic,

248
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:47,219
the EPA figure is about thirty-seven percent

249
00:09:47,219 --> 00:09:50,178
lower than Porsche's thirty-kilometre claim.

250
00:09:50,358 --> 00:09:54,414
The difference between a manufacturer's ideal conditions

251
00:09:54,414 --> 00:09:56,732
