257
00:10:11,096 --> 00:10:12,377
By our arithmetic,

258
00:10:12,377 --> 00:10:14,939
that is ninety-three miles per hour.

259
00:10:15,119 --> 00:10:16,945
And the charging figures:

260
00:10:16,945 --> 00:10:19,866
about four hours from a ten-amp 230-volt

261
00:10:19,866 --> 00:10:22,860
socket, about two hours with the Charging

