264
00:10:28,541 --> 00:10:28,843
Weight.

265
00:10:29,023 --> 00:10:32,245
Wikipedia lists the nine eighteen's curb weight

266
00:10:32,245 --> 00:10:35,741
as sixteen hundred thirty-four to seventeen hundred

267
00:10:35,741 --> 00:10:36,906
twenty kilograms.

268
00:10:37,086 --> 00:10:40,752
Porsche's release says about sixteen hundred forty

269
00:10:40,752 --> 00:10:42,512
in the Weissach package,

270
00:10:42,512 --> 00:10:45,518
with the package reducing gross weight by

271
00:10:45,518 --> 00:10:47,570
